Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家动起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要裸戏、报警电话、女人打架。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want nudity, 911 calls, cat fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我弄点好看的电视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me some good TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们的男嘉宾，亚当·克伦威尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your suitor, Adam Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多双眼睛都在盯着你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a lot of eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是第一位黑人男嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the first black suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:20.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要我的龙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need my dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我负责创造条件，让事情发生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I create conditions for things to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说每一句话，然后跟着我重复。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to everything I say and just repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意嫁给我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱情很美好……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love is swell...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:30.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你不能把人生建立在爱情上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it is not something you build a life around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我多少次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many times have you made me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这些人面前像个傻瓜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}look like a fool in front of these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想降我的职？当着我的面说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to demote me? You demote me to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别这样，妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't do that, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很抱歉让你觉得被评判了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry you feel judged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:42.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以没关系。-别给我做心理分析。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So it's okay.   -Don't shrink me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想跟我回家吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要孩子，可我生不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want kids, and I can't have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会成为任何人的失望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't be anybody's disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特？你他妈在这里干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet? What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要夺回我的王国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking my kingdom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What in the hell are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要让别人来负责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm putting someone else in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼·沃瑟曼，请进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman Wasserman, come in here please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:00.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在由他负责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is the one in charge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会让你碰这个地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna let you touch this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:04.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是记者。那个叫玛丽的女人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a reporter. That woman Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去年从屋顶跳下去的那个，那是谋杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who jumped off the roof last year, that was a murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼知道玛丽的事，他就要曝光我们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman knows about Mary, and he's about to expose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我们真的得阻止他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right now, we really have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你再也不用担心他们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't ever have to worry about them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:14.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉过你，我什么都愿意做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you I'd do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:17.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}11点有突发新闻直播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have live breaking news at 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应急人员已赶到单车事故现场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Emergency crews are on the scene of a single-car accident
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}地点在贝伍德峡谷路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at Baywood Canyon Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谎言会害死我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lies are what kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}维持那些谎言的压力就是毒药。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The stress of keeping up those lies is poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:34.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们每说一个谎，就离坟墓更近一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every lie we tell is one step closer to the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.27,0:01:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}惊喜吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你过去六个月就在干这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this is what you've been doing for the past six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:06.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂在水里、放放羊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Floating in the water and tending goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我，呃——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在坚持做这种疗愈练习\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm committed to this healing practice
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫“本质诚实”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}called "Essential Honesty."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我在做我自己版本，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I'm doing my own version of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:18.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但就是，不说谎——永远不说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's like, no lies -- ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。你真觉得你的问题就是这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. Is that really what you thought your problem was?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说谎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚来这儿的时候，总是在操控别人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I first got here, I was just producing people all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}操纵他们，让他们给我想要的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Manipulating them into giving me what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:36.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我疗程的一部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's part of my program.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我写下我说过的所有谎话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I write down all the lies I've ever told.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:41.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后统计我没说谎的天数。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I tally up the days that I've been lie-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我正在连续保持诚实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm on a sober streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈。有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh. Well, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个更好的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:59.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我知道我们说好六个月，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, look, I know that we said six months, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在状态很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in a really good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我不好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:05.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》真的要被砍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everlasting" is about to be canceled for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。他们招不到广告商\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. They can't get any advertisers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为上一季那场公关噩梦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because of the whole PR nightmare last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以前在派对上蹭我腿的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, people who used to dry-hump my leg at parties
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在连电话都不回我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}now won't even call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要《永恒》重新运转起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need "Everlasting" to be back up and running
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我才能建立我的帝国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so that I can build my empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:32.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我说出来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是女版埃隆·马斯克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the female Elon Musk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:56.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她性感、火辣、聪明，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's hot, sexy, smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但单身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but single.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我们这一代的瘟疫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a plague of our generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像她这样的女人，什么都做对了——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women like her, they do everything right --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事业超成功，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}got banging careers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:10.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有约会软件都用过——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they've been on every dating app --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她们越成功，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but the more successful they get,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就越难找到合适的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the harder it is to find the right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-听着很压抑。  -更像是现实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sounds depressing.   -More like real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是外面世界的真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the truth of the world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可能终于能让我们拿艾美奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This could finally be our Emmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾美奖？不如我们先按时完成拍摄？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An Emmy? How about we just make our days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者先从简单的事开始，比如，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or how about we start with something simple, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我不知道，没人死掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I don't know, nobody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜就是我们的女嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena is our girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是女权主义女嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the feminist suitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好，听我说，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, listen, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道楼上的高层在给你施压\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know the brass upstairs is busting your balls
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于这些粉红帽子、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about all this pink-hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女性赋权那套鬼话和配额。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}female-empowerment crap and quotas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜符合很多条件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena ticks off a lot of boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能让他们不再烦你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can get them off your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白你的事业已经命悬一线了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do realize that your career's on life support, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我知道，加里。  -但我们替你兜了底。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Gary.   -But we covered for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:56.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们让你把瓦格斯坦推出去背锅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We let you throw Wagerstein under the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但像你这样的人不能犯两次同样的错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But people like you cannot make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说像我这样的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean women like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特可以活得像个行走的小丑游行……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet can live his life like a walking bozo parade...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿。嘿！  -……但我不行，我一次就完蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey. Hey!   -...but me, I'm one and done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，好吧，行。听着，批准了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, all right, right. Listen, it's a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:11.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果这事像去年一样搞砸，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if this goes south, like last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就被解雇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾美奖？说得倒好听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An Emmy? Nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:20.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant it, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得开始想想给我儿子留下什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to start thinking what I'm leaving behind for my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是我从那件事之后就见不到他了，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}especially since I can't see him since the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你绑架了他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You kidnapped him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让他知道我这辈子做了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want him to know what I did with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。 -嘿，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪呢？你要让她回来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about Maddie? You bringing her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么关心麦迪逊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you care about Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你不是吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪是未来，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maddie's the future, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:42.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。谢谢你，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. Thanks, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:59.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不该穿短裤的。离开1号频道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shouldn't have worn shorts. Get off of channel 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋。怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rach. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，有点崩溃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, kind of freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我喘不过气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:07.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我来月经了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I've got my period.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实量挺大的。 -恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's pretty heavy, actually.   -Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但你知道吗？我会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but you know what? I'm gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会挺过去的。我一直都能。总能挺过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna make it through. I always do. Always make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酷，见到你也很高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool, it's nice to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你—— -才不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to -- -It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:16.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-见到我很高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Nice to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹，拜托。咱们别废话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan, come on. Let's just cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们就完全坦诚，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just be totally honest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:21.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。  -我们互相受不了对方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -We can't stand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.82,0:06:23.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会那么说。我是说——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't say that. I mean --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就说实话。会让你感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just tell the truth. It's gonna make you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好多了，我发誓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so much better, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好吧，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, all right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是，呃——见到你有点吓人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's, uh -- It's kind of terrifying to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-让我压力超大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Totally stresses me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧？ -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-See?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，很好。这很好。咱们继续保持。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, great. This is great. Let's keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-感觉确实不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It does feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我其实可以…… -那是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I could actually...   -Is that --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是“本质诚实”吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that "Essential Honesty"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那——来——对我用。对我用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That -- Do -- Do it on me. Do it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，切特。这不是派对把戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Chet. It's not a party trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，小怪胎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, little weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请别那么叫我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't call me that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，“小怪胎”？那是爱称。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, "little weirdo"? It's a term of endearment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那不好笑，因为让我很不舒服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, it's not funny 'cause it flips me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。我想知道你怎么看我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. I want to know what you think about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我说实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:00.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.89,0:07:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个拿钱太多、呃、什么都不会的巨婴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you are an overpaid, uh, incompetent man-baby
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠着女人上位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who's riding on the backs of women
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让她们替你干所有的活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who do all of your work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你蠢到根本不知道这有多可悲：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're too dumb to know how pathetic it is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们居然得利用你把塞蕾娜推给电视台，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we had to use you to push Serena through to the network
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为你是带把的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just because you were born with a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我一直不懂奎恩看上你哪点，又胖又出汗、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I never understood what Quinn saw in your fat, sweaty,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还嗑药的混蛋，但不管是什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}drug-addled ass, but whatever it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你浪费了她人生最好的几年，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you wasted the best years of her life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:27.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还毁了唯一一个会关心你的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and destroyed the one person who is ever gonna care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，这就是实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在去拿对讲机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna go get my walkie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:40.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回去干活！别傻站着！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back to work! Stop standing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:42.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是暂时的。她一周内就会缓过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just a phase. She'll be out of it in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望她在那之前别杀人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope she doesn't kill somebody between now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嘿，瑞秋，听着，我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey, Rachel, listen, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五分钟，格雷厄姆。就五分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Five minutes, Graham. Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:55.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢谢你，瑞秋。  -不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank you, Rachel.   -You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎恩。格雷厄姆，只穿塑身裤。嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn. Graham, just the Spanx on. Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿。  -嘿，火药桶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.   -Hey, loose cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:01.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你要不要跟我解释一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, would you like to explain to me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面到底发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what the hell happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那只是真相的净化之火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was just the cleansing fire of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:07.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，好。  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, okay.   -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:10.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我需要你振作起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I am going to need you to get your shit together
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为切特还是你老板，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because Chet is still your boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且不管你喜欢与否，加里信任他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, like it or not, Gary trusts him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他当然信任。  -还有，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Of course he does.   -And look,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很感谢你刚才替我出头，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really appreciate you standing up for me back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，但我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}seriously, but I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:22.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:32.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗨。  -哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi.   -Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个邪教真是把你整得不轻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They, like, really did a number on you at that cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是邪教，是农场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a cult. It's a farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，一样的。瑞秋，根本就是一回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, it's the same thing. Rachel, it's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对了，欢迎回家。  -就是邪教。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, welcome home, by the way.   -It's a cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟人约好了谈那个提案，所以，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I set up our meeting for that pitch, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我们一开工，你把你有的东西告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as soon as we're up and running, let me know what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么提案？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老爸要闪人了，姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daddy's getting on up out of here, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:48.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那节目讲什么的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the show about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点头绪都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
