Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:14.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真高兴又见到你。我只是——我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So good to see you again. I just -- I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真不敢相信你来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I honestly can't even believe you're here.
