Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你看起来不像爱吹牛的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, you don't seem like a bullshitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在确实不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm currently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴你来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm glad you're here.
