Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，奎恩，他在这里才是隐患。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Quinn, he is a liability in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我把话说完，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hear me out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:39.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道上季我的所作所为没有任何借口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know there's no excuse for how I was last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我——我戒酒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm -- I'm sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我上过情绪管理课，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I've been through anger-management classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:46.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm just so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打你是我这辈子做过最糟的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hitting you is the worst thing that I've ever done.
