Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而现在，人们的观感是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And right now, the perception is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上季结尾发生了一场可怕的车祸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that there was a terrible car crash at the end of last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，事情就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是意外，我们大家是一条船上的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was an accident, and we are all in this together.
