Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:14.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我们需要一个约定，有约束力的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we need a pact, something binding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血誓。-不，太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-A blood oath.   -No, that is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:21.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听着，我们得做点什么，才能让小怪胎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, listen, we got to do something so little weirdo
