Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我加入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're insane, Chet.
