Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:59.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们发誓对这件事保持本质上的沉默。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We vow to stay essentially silent about this one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，塞蕾娜不肯去片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, Serena won't go to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这颜色太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This color is fabulous.
