Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意参与这个过程的态度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}willingness to participate in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。我自己带了裙子，我就穿那条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I brought my own dress. I'll wear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:41.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那倒是挺好，如果你是要去领诺贝尔奖的话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That'd be great, if you were accepting the Nobel Prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是来钓个老公的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not trying to catch a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.60,0:12:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本不知道该怎么跟人说话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I don't even know how to talk to people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:46.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胸露得这么低的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with my tits out this far.
