Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的把你们的隐私信息给你们了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}actually gave you guys confidential information?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.11,0:17:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-差不多吧。  -真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, pretty much.   -That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听着，佩服你，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, listen hat's off, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个真正的心理医生。这可不简单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a real-ass shrink. That's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}名片上就是这么写的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what it says on the business card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么会来这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How'd you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是需要换换环境，你懂的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just needed a change, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:34.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我之前做企业危机顾问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was working as a corporate crisis counselor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做了十年——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the last decade --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}客户都是濒临崩溃的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}clients who were at a breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}具体是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meaning what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我解决问题——很快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I solve problems -- quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你擅长吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You any good at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:49.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通常，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Usually, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通常。听起来有故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Usually. That sounds like a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我上一个客户是个，呃，华尔街交易员，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My last client was a, uh, Wall Street trader
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}承受着巨大的工作压力，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}facing significant stress from work,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有家庭破裂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as well as a family breakup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢，你解决他的问题了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so, what, you resolved his issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不算解决。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:10.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他彻底失控了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He went postal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开枪杀了他的同事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shot and killed his colleague...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在我负责期间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}under my care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到了吧？不是只有你会……说大实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see? You're not the only who can be...essentially honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel? Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.28,0:18:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是，我在试。认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, I'm trying. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事我们得谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna have to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，塞雷娜，呃，我们得马上带你进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Serena, uh, we got to get you in there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-确实。  -今晚不许喝酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sure is.   -No booze tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉大家。我是说所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell everyone. I mean, all the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:39.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉了。所有人都说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told everyone. I told everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。临场发挥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's perfect. Wing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.69,0:18:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，敬一个出色又高效的一季。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, to a superior and effective season.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果所有男人瞬间都蔫了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And all the dicks just went limp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为健康干杯。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Na zdorovie.   -Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，她好无聊。戈德堡，上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh, she's boring. Goldberg, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是牧场主，不只是牛仔。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a rancher, not just a cowboy. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，希望你不是素食主义者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hoping you're not a vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不，我很爱上好的肋眼牛排。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. I love a good rib eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪一下，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you excuse me for just one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好啊。没问题。  -好，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah. Right on.   -Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想给你介绍一下扎克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want to introduce you to Zach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:17.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有三百五十万粉丝。-好多啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He has 3 1/2 million followers.   -That's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-很高兴见到你。  -嘿，很高兴见到你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's so nice to meet you.   -Hey, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:20.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能给我一秒钟吗，就一下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you give me just one second, really quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:21.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能跟你聊两句吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你弄诺曼来干什么？拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing with Norman? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他明显是被弄来当笑柄的，这太残忍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's clearly here as a sight guy, which is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，很多女人觉得骑师很有魅力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. So many women find jockeys attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做过调查的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have done my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你们在酒店里还藏着备选男嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that you have backup guys in the hotel somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托把诺曼弄走，给我个像样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please get rid of Norman and get me someone real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不行，但我们可以——-拜托给我个像样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We can't. But we -- -Please get me someone real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:41.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，说真的——我穿高跟鞋比他高快一英尺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, honestly -- in heels, I'm like a foot taller than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你老实说，这合理吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you honestly tell me that makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:50.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是来供人取乐的。-谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He is here for entertainment.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他对节目非常有用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he is very good for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不在乎节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care about the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:59.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，诺曼至少能给我们三集的剧情，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Norman gives us at least three episodes of story,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.37,0:20:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我只是求你，行吗，就当帮我个忙，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I am just asking you, okay, as a favor to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能，先别把他淘汰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}can you please, just, don't cut him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯珀。怎么回事，大明星？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jasper. What is going on, superstar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想进去看看吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to, like, get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想。我……正沉浸其中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. I am, uh...deep in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，看看这个，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, check this, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是没玩得开心，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you not having fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:21.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是你就是那种喜欢站边上看的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or you're just a stand-on-the-sidelines kind of guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不是。我根本不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no. I'm not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那种站边上看戏的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a stand-on-the-sidelines kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:27.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我经营自己的私募股权公司，专攻替代——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I run my own private equity firm, which specializes in alt--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.53,0:20:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}替代能源。对，我谷歌过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alternative energy. Yes, I Googled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-搞什么——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What the --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说服了一个堪萨斯来的19岁制片助理，让我用他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I convinced some 19-year-old P.A. from Kansas to let me use his.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你们哪个蠢——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, which one of you numb
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我是汤米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, go for Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嗨，汤米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hi, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被开除了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈哈！今晚第一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha ha! First one of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉不错。-我得问你——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Feels good.   -I have to ask you --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上这个节目干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here on this show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Same thing as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你在找老公。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you're looking for a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的。你也听说了。  -哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I am, yes. You'd heard.   -Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:20:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我上哪儿能找到人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know where I could find anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周围有几个合适的单身汉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a few eligible bachelors around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，突然变得这么会说话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, very charming now all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去年我出去玩了一趟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went on a trip last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给自己报了个二世谷的直升机滑雪团。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I took myself on a heli-skiing tour in Niseko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:09.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道你去过没有，但那真是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if you've ever been, but it's --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去过，我爱日本。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I love Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚从那儿回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just came from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那真是不可思议——真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it was incredible -- really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香槟粉雪，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Champagne powder,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你见过的最大的雪花。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}biggest flakes you have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绵延不绝的古松。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Endless ancient pines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:25.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，我的感官完全被——被美淹没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really, my senses were just overwhelmed with -- with beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:27.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我环顾四周，发现\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I looked around, and I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有我和一群陌生人一起旅行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that it was just me and a bunch of strangers on a tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再也不想感到那么孤独了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't ever want to feel that alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后……内裤掉一地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And...panty drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在全美国都想嫁给他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now all of America wants to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we gonna do about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.71,0:21:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我想你得带我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I think you're going to take me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去第一次一对一约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the first one-on-one date.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:59.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我想你得争取一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then, I think you're gonna have to earn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，塞蕾娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。-嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.53,0:22:09.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，还好赶上你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. I'm glad I caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这儿竞争挺激烈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, this is a kind of crowded field here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这儿有很多有趣的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, there are a lot of interesting guys here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只对你感兴趣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm only interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:18.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诺曼，能跟你聊一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Norman, can I talk to you for just a quick second?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔法就是在这里发生的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is where magic happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，这里有好多屏幕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. There are just, like, so many screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.85,0:22:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道看哪儿了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，借过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:33.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我——-给。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I -- -Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你一定是奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you must be Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说过很多你的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've heard so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.19,0:22:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克丽丝托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.59,0:22:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃，我是切特的学生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um I am a student of Chet's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也是女朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.63,0:22:48.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用觉得尴尬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:50.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没尴尬。我只是想保持专业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not embarrassed. I'm trying to be professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦。  -你做的事让我超佩服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh.   -I'm so super impressed by what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你做什么的，克丽丝托？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what do you do, Crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是模特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.21,0:23:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主要是泳装，但那只是为了供我读完——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Swimsuits mostly, but that's just to put me through --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.85,0:23:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡尔格罗夫？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calgrove?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续教育，不过——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Extension, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.95,0:23:07.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我不想浪费你的时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I-I don't want to waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:10.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们有一整晚。  -不，我是说在节目上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well, we've got all night.   -No, I mean, on the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制片人想让我留下你，但那只是图个新鲜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}T-The producers want me to keep you, but it's a novelty thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.23,0:23:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们没把你当回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're not taking you seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没把我当回事？我可是精英运动员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not taking me seriously? I'm an elite athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:20.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我不想让他们拿你当笑料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is why I don't want them playing you for laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很感激。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……我现在要淘汰你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...I'm gonna cut you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行！停！停！停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Cut! Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太离谱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:37.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿，听着，我跟她说过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, listen, I told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-麦迪逊！  -我求她别淘汰他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Madison!   -I asked her not to cut him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.22,0:23:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你求她了？你可真贴心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you asked her? That's so sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-瑞秋。  -对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rachel.   -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟她说话。跟我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't talk to her. Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:45.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。我跟瑞秋说过了，我要一个备选男嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. I told Rachel I want a backup guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你得给我找一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now you have to get me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:50.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来处理，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll handle it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，你最好这样，因为这是你的选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you'd better 'cause this is your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:53.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把她管好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get her under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.06,0:23:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:57.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要我给你拿杯喝的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I get you a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:00.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，你能带我离开这儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, can you get me out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:02.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.17,0:24:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—太好了。  -—嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Great.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.28,0:24:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过，她很聪明。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you, she's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.11,0:24:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不能用同样的方式应付她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't handle her the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你绝不会容忍——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you would never stand for --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.71,0:24:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这么做就是这个原因？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that why you're doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你选她也是因为这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that why you picked her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.76,0:24:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不是你我任何一方的化身，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is not the avatar for you or me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不是全世界聪明女性的代表。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}nor is she the ambassador for smart women everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.93,0:24:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她只是一档真人秀的明星，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is the star of a reality television show
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:31.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我要把这档节目做下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I have to make work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.00,0:24:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在能做的最有女性立场的事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The most feminist thing you could do right now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.91,0:24:38.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是帮我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。看这景色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow. Look at that view.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.26,0:24:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。我真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:55.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.13,0:24:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—欧……  -—欧文！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-O...   -Owen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.33,0:24:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嗯哼。  -—欧文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh-huh.   -Owen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:24:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——是。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.73,0:25:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来这儿是来和你约会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here to date you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.67,0:25:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。这真是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God. This is --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一切真让人不知所措。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, this is all so overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.64,0:25:11.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？你看起来特别自信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? You seem so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.64,0:25:12.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我不知道。我还以为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I don't know. I would have thought
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.94,0:25:14.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对你来说就是又一个周一晚上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this was just another Monday night for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.95,0:25:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着——我的生活比大家想的无聊多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen -- my life is a lot more boring than people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.25,0:25:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嗯。  -—我是说，26次初次约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mm.   -I mean, 26 first dates
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.05,0:25:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同时进行，确实够呛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all at the same time is a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我懂那种感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.83,0:25:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我驻守费卢杰的时候，也经历过一些糟糕的夜晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had some bad nights when I was stationed in Fallujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——我和连队失散了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I got separated from my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.10,0:25:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还救了一个差点被杀的小男孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Saved a little boy from being killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.70,0:25:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那只是————好了好了，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was just -- -All right, all right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.77,0:25:38.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——我真是个混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm -- I'm a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.74,0:25:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.21,0:25:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方对我也有些招架不住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place is all a bit much for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.21,0:25:45.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是个挺简单的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretty simple guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.01,0:25:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个为国而战的普通人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a simple guy who fought for his country
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.92,0:25:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在还从着火的楼里救老太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and now rescues little old ladies from burning buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.69,0:25:55.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，有时候也救小猫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, sometimes it is kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.72,0:25:56.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course it is.
