Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都做到了。剪、剪、剪、剪、剪、剪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've achieved. Cut, cut, cut, cut, cut, cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.68,0:36:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会想对着这个自慰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody's gonna want to jerk off to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.48,0:36:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会对着《永恒》自慰啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who jerks off to "Everlasting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.71,0:36:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁不会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.41,0:36:56.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.88,0:36:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的要每天都来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you really gonna be here every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.72,0:37:01.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，你已经向电视台推荐了塞蕾娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you already pitched Serena to the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.92,0:37:04.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还带女朋友来参加首播夜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You brought your girlfriend by for opening night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿的活儿不是干完了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't your work here done?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.86,0:37:08.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才刚开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.69,0:37:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对艾美奖这事是认真的，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm serious about this Emmy thing, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，当然。说得通。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, sure. That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.86,0:37:15.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整套中年危机那套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This whole mid-life crisis thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是危机，Quinnie。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a crisis, Quinnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.47,0:37:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是觉醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.97,0:37:22.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，但我是说，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, but I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.51,0:37:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Crystal？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.51,0:37:27.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样更简单，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just easier, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.88,0:37:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她更省心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.34,0:37:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.77,0:37:55.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿。  -嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.41,0:37:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.58,0:37:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这听起来很装，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know this is gonna sound pretentious,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.41,0:38:01.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我的房间实在太憋闷了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but my room is just too confining.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.95,0:38:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我习惯在星空下睡觉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm used to sleeping out under the stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.12,0:38:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼吸新鲜空气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.12,0:38:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该找机会试试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.65,0:38:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我其实也想过加入\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I was actually thinking about joining
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.96,0:38:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和平队，去待上一阵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the Peace Corps for a while, too, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.59,0:38:12.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-但后来，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But then, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.89,0:38:14.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}生活挡住了路什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}life got in the way or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.43,0:38:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，对。-对，就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So, but yeah.   -Yeah. Yeah, it does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.06,0:38:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你打算去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, where were you thinking of going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:19.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在考虑去非洲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was thinking about Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.86,0:38:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，我太爱非洲了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, man. I love Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.63,0:38:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，确实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.57,0:38:26.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们总在谈论它，可你真到了那儿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, people talk about it, but when you go there,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.91,0:38:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直超乎你的想象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's just beyond your comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.57,0:38:30.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太多——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So much --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.54,0:38:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.08,0:38:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有空吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.65,0:38:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头见。 好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-See ya.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.95,0:38:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.75,0:38:42.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——听着，我在自己身上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I -- Look, I'm serious about the work
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.12,0:38:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下的功夫是认真的，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I've been doing on myself, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.69,0:38:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I wouldn't --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.96,0:38:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，你就是个疯子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, you are an insane person.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管你做了什么戒断治疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care about what rehab you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.99,0:38:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.80,0:38:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，你害死了两个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, you killed two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.03,0:38:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.56,0:38:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我是说，你到底怎么想的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I mean, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.77,0:38:56.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么下得去手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.13,0:38:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:00.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为是你让我做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.01,0:39:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.68,0:39:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。不可能。我当时在气头上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No way. No way. I was upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.95,0:39:11.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在跟你发泄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was venting to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.18,0:39:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样，瑞秋。你了解我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Rach. You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.95,0:39:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我会动手的。你就是想让我这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You knew that I'd do something. You wanted me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.85,0:39:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.16,0:39:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我那么做是为了让你不进监狱，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did it to keep you out of jail, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.96,0:39:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我还爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I still love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.50,0:39:25.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.50,0:39:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.50,0:39:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，一切都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.57,0:39:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头见，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see you, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.58,0:39:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我只是想确认你没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, um, I just want to make sure you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:48.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？你干嘛要在意这些？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Why do you even care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.02,0:39:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不是为我来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not even here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.53,0:39:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是为我来的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you here for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.97,0:40:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。 好了，瑞……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, my God.   -Okay, Ra...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.90,0:40:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.05,0:40:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.19,0:40:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.79,0:40:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她情况怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, how's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.53,0:40:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她第一晚就喝得烂醉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She got really drunk on the first night,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.13,0:40:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一个男的亲热，然后又把人家给剪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}made out with a guy, and then cut him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.63,0:40:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是女嘉宾——是奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not the suitress -- Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.90,0:40:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她已经不行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think she's got it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.74,0:40:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真的。 嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, really.   -Unh-unh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……你想跳到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...do you want to jump to the part
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.82,0:40:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她开始谈梦想婚礼那部分吗，还是……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}where she starts talking about her dream wedding or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.85,0:40:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倒回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.82,0:40:59.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.22,0:41:01.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很擅长我的工作，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really, really good at my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.09,0:41:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想为此道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I don't want to have to apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.59,0:41:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这段放进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put that in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.60,0:41:07.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:09.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.90,0:41:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
